# Luma calendar API key — required by /api/events.
#
# Get it at luma.com/calendar/manage/api-keys (Settings -> Developer).
# Requires a Luma Plus subscription on that calendar.
#
# This key grants FULL access to the calendar it is scoped to, including
# creating/cancelling events and reading guest lists. Never commit it, never
# expose it to the browser, never paste it into a client-side file.
LUMA_API_KEY=
